{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act52side_level_act52side_04_end","storyGroup":"act52side","storySort":9,"storyDependence":"act52side_level_act52side_04_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"YW-4","storyName":"走上街道","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"互助会的岛民劫持了通讯信号，袭击为打捞起重机供能的灯塔。船厂的一名船工失踪，德·托莱多决意找人。德鲁莎只身前往互助会所在地。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act52side/level_act52side_04_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act52side_04_end","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":7,"next":9,"characters":["通讯声A","通讯声B","无线电","岛民","墙上的刻字","守塔人A","守塔人B","惩戒军士官","惩戒军士兵","？？？","圣徒卡门","制帆匠","特菲","瑟缩的平民","巡逻的惩戒军？","德鲁莎"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_sunlight_r","layer":"1","y":"200","id":5},{"type":"playsound","key":"$beach","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":6},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/eb/Avg_bg_27_g24_cloudy_sea.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","id":7},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"-65","xTo":"65","duration":"30","block":"false","id":8},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":10},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$tech_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta2_180603/m_sys_tech_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":11,"musicid":0},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_transmissionget","id":12},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"通讯声A","text":"我曾经觉得大海每天都是一个样。","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"通讯声A","text":"浑浊，吝啬，没有尽头，连一条鳞都不肯施舍。","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"通讯声A","text":"现在看来是我以前站得不够高，明明每一个浪头，每一块礁石，每一阵海风的气味都不一样。","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"通讯声B","text":"……","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"通讯声B","text":"请汇报今天的海面情况和灯塔运行数据，守塔人。","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"通讯声A","text":"别那么一本正经的，艾尔玛。我知道你羡慕我的工作，从这里看到的风景简直不像我前半生认识的伊比利亚。","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"通讯声A","text":"可惜，还要等几天港都中心城区才能被打捞起来，现在除了清扫海域的船只，海面上看不到任何东西。","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"通讯声A","text":"而且刚修复完的供能灯塔闻上去有股新家的味道，不知道其余三十六座是不是也这样——","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"通讯声B","text":"拉蒙！汇报情况！","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"通讯声A","text":"知道了，知道了……","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"通讯声A","text":"三个月以来什么意外都没发生过，而且每座灯塔都有惩戒军小队驻守，你根本不用那么焦虑，凌晨出门的时候你都把我吵醒了……","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"通讯声A","text":"上午8点49分，海洋监测汇报，沿岸风力五级，阵风六级，未监测到风暴潮。","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"通讯声A","text":"今天是个好日子，长官。","id":26},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":27},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":28},{"type":"dialog","id":29},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":30},{"type":"charslot","id":31},{"type":"bgeffect","id":32},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":33},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_bg_bg_ibindoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":34},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":35},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":36},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$plot_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_plot_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":37,"musicid":1},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"无线电","text":"……滋……海洋监测汇报……滋……","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"无线电","text":"……沿岸风力……未监测到风暴潮……","id":40},{"type":"dialog","id":41},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2272_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":42},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":43},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openfoodcan","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岛民","text":"（打开罐头）","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_2272_1$1.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sheepchewpaper","loop":"true","channel":"jj","id":46},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"jj","fadetime":"2","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岛民","text":"（咀嚼）","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_2272_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":49},{"type":"text","text":"一个鳞罐头，一把贝壳叉子，一顿普通的伊比利亚早餐。","id":50},{"type":"text","text":"他像一名普通的伊比利亚人一样喝完罐头里的汁水，来自大海的盐分会为他提供必要的能量。","id":51},{"type":"charslot","id":52},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"无线电","text":"……七号灯塔……供能系统运转稳定……","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"无线电","text":"……三十一号……动态载荷监测系统已开启……","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"无线电","text":"……十四……通讯信号一切正常……","id":56},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2272_1#1$1","id":57},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_fauceton","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岛民","text":"（清洗餐具）","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_2272_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岛民","text":"（清洗罐头）","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_2272_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":61},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":62},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_open_drawer","id":63},{"type":"text","text":"他将叉子收进抽屉，又将接满净水的罐头放在房间的角落。","id":64},{"type":"text","text":"一只云兽跳进破损的窗户，绕过地上的石头和碎玻璃，走向水源。","id":65},{"type":"charslot","id":66},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"无线电","text":"……号灯塔……驻守供能灯塔的人数不变……","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"无线电","text":"……一个小时后换班……明白……","id":69},{"type":"dialog","id":70},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2272_1#1$1","id":71},{"type":"playsound","key":"$p_imp_funnel_end_h","id":72},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岛民","text":"……","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_2272_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":75},{"type":"text","text":"海藻晾晒的时日不够，他还不能收回来；窗户三天前就该修补，所幸最近没有下雨。","id":76},{"type":"text","text":"他环视一周，只拿起捕鳞钩，离开了家。","id":77},{"type":"dialog","id":78},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_fishhook_pickup","id":79},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":80},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":81},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorclosequite","id":82},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":83},{"type":"playsound","key":"$beach","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":84},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":85},{"type":"text","text":"海风吹起窗帘，斑驳的墙壁替曾经的住民言语。","id":86},{"type":"dialog","id":87},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","id":88},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"3","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"0.7","id":89},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":90},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_blackmask","layer":"1","id":91},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"墙上的刻字","text":"（被划去的伊比利亚经文）<i>“用盐摩擦伤口，疼痛是德行的印证，使异种的血肉无处滋长。”</i>","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"墙上的刻字","text":"（错乱的阿戈尔语）<i>他们不会宽恕，我们不会原谅。</i>","id":94},{"type":"dialog","id":95},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":96},{"type":"dialog","id":97},{"type":"charslot","id":98},{"type":"bgeffect","id":99},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":100},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":101},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_bg_27_g20_lighthouse_core.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":102},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":103},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2275_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":105},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2274_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":106},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":107},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"守塔人A","text":"海面起浪了，明明一个小时前汇报的时候还好好的。","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_2274_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"l","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"守塔人B","text":"害怕了？","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_2275_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"守塔人A","text":"我是嫌麻烦。","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_2274_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"守塔人A","text":"海况会影响供能系统运行，驻守的惩戒军正在换班，我们还得自己联络岗哨的通讯员，让他们通知打捞中心的人，调整水下作业的安排。","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_2274_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"守塔人A","text":"唉，等港都中心城区重新升起，我们就能安安心心地数着海面上的帆船，不用再做这样麻烦的联络工作了。","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_2274_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"l","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"守塔人B","text":"得了吧，我看你倒是很享受，还能借着工作时间和艾尔玛聊天。","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_2275_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"守塔人A","text":"唔，不对。","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_2274_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"l","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"守塔人B","text":"你还想狡辩？刚刚你们的通讯我可是都在这里听到了——","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_2275_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"守塔人A","text":"我是说通讯声不对。我们的射频滤波器出问题了？怎么信号断断续续的？","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_2274_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"l","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"守塔人B","text":"哦，正常。最近两个月里时不时就这么来一次，一会儿就好。","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_2275_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"守塔人A","text":"看来阿戈尔技术的产物也不是那么好用啊……","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_2274_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"l","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"守塔人B","text":"水土不服嘛，打捞中心的新监事已经开始优化所有技术配件了，灯塔供能系统的硬件过几天也能更新。","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_2275_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"守塔人B","text":"而且再不济我们这儿也有人维修啊，是从打捞中心来的，那个岛民叫什么来着？","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_2275_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"守塔人A","text":"不记得。","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_2274_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"l","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"守塔人B","text":"哦，正好，他来了。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_2275_1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":135},{"type":"dialog","id":136},{"type":"charslot","id":137},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":138},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":139},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":140},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2272_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":141},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岛民","text":"……","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_2272_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":144},{"type":"charslot","id":145},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2272_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2273_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":147},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":148},{"type":"dialog","id":149},{"type":"charslot","id":150},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2275_1#1$1","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"守塔人B","text":"不对劲……拉蒙，快呼叫岗哨！","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_2275_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2272_1#1$1","id":153},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_fishhook_pickup","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岛民","text":"（举起捕鳞钩）","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_2272_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":156},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":157},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hammer","id":158},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":159},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":160},{"type":"charslot","id":161},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":162},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_bg_74_g9_gdsentry.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":163},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":164},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":165},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ponder_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":166,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2276_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":167},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2277_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":168},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":169},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"信号中断多久了？","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_2277_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"l","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士兵","text":"七分钟。","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2276_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士兵","text":"三十七座灯塔的通讯信号被一并劫持，通讯员还在排查设备故障的原因，还不确定是哪座灯塔遇袭导致的。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2276_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"距离最后的打捞工作结束还有一周，这个时候袭击为起重机供能的灯塔矩阵，袭击者是想破坏打捞计划，让伊比利亚和阿戈尔生隙……","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_2277_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"驻守灯塔的惩戒军呢？","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_2277_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"l","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士兵","text":"除了离岗哨最近的三支队伍外，其余小队全部失联。","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2276_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士兵","text":"这三支小队刚刚回来，他们都说自己收到了审判庭中枢的加密通讯，要求小队马上到岗哨待命，我猜测其他小队也收到了假消息。","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2276_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"袭击者不可能自投罗网，这三支小队驻守的灯塔离岗哨太近，大概率不是他们的目标。","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_2277_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"我们必须立刻确认其余三十四座供能灯塔的情况。","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_2277_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"l","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士兵","text":"长官，供能灯塔位置太过分散，而且大多地处偏远。我们现在无法得知袭击者的人数，也不知道他们到底入侵了哪座灯塔……","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2276_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"让驻守岗哨的所有人员立刻出动，沿水道行军，前往其余的三十四座灯塔确认情况。","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_2277_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"行动组一组前往海岸，提防水中异动，别让恐鱼成为潜在威胁。","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_2277_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"二组负责沿街盘查，寻找可靠目击者，尽可能掌握袭击者的动向。","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_2277_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"l","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士兵","text":"明白。巡逻组怎么安排？","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2276_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"在原本的巡逻路线上待命，我们已经收到圣徒阁下的指示，优先排除街道上的潜在威胁，保障平民的安全。","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_2277_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"l","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士兵","text":"可这样一来支援灯塔的人手就不够了，万一供能系统被毁，那港都中心城区的打捞计划就彻底……","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2276_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"伊比利亚必将迎回它原本辉煌的心脏。","id":197},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"圣徒阁下。","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_2277_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":200},{"type":"charslot","id":201},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":202},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":203},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":204},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"但当下哪怕打捞计划受阻，我们也要避免岛民和伊比利亚民众之间长久以来的积怨再度被挑动。","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"一座在积怨与晦暗中升起的城市，对伊比利亚又有何益？","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2276_1#1$1","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士兵","text":"明白！","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2276_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"行动吧。命令通讯队继续排查设备故障，争取尽快恢复通讯信号，以及……","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"联络克莱门莎监事，我们需要援助。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":213},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":214},{"type":"charslot","id":215},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":216},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_bg_74_g8_shipatelier.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":217},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":218},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":219},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":220},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":221},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2274_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":222},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制帆匠","text":"发生什么了，船厂外怎么有那么多审判庭的队伍经过？","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_2274_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制帆匠","text":"而且为什么斐戴拉大审判官说，船厂的任何相关人员不得出于任何理由离开船厂？难道外面发生了动乱……","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_2274_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#1$1","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"好了好了，知道那些惩戒军为什么让我们待在这儿吗？","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#4$1","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"是因为我们——堂堂王室海军舰队预备军的震慑力太强，不适合在这种场合露面。那些惩戒军肯定是完全能搞定，才不劳烦我们出去的。","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2274_1#1$1","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制帆匠","text":"“……祈祷诸位能驱使审判的灯火……洗涤我们的戴罪之身……”","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_2274_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#12$1","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"唉，萨尔瓦多整天念这几句，搞得大家都学会了……不对，他人呢？","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2274_1#1$1","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制帆匠","text":"我、我不知道。外面起了动静之后就没见过他了。","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_2274_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#2$1","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"……","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2274_1#1$1","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"制帆匠","text":"等等，德·托莱多大人，别去找他了，斐戴拉大审判官再三强调……","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_2274_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#7$1","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"我听到了，那个大审判官嗓门大得像地震。但这也代表船厂的惩戒军不会动，哪怕上报有人失踪也根本不会调派人手去找。","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"他的家人都在原本的村镇，等着他在这里修船领到的薪酬，不能让他不明不白地没了音讯。虽然他还不是我德·托莱多的拥护者，但……","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#13$1","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"保不齐之后他就成了我麾下的一员呢？","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#7$1","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"我要去找他。","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_393_toledo_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":247},{"type":"dialog","id":248},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":249},{"type":"charslot","id":250},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":251},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_bg_74_g5_gdsquare_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":252},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":253},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_armywalking","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":254},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2276_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":255},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2276_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":256},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"1.5","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"1.5","id":258},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":259},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":260},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":261},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":262},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_459_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":263},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瑟缩的平民","text":"好多审判庭的队伍，今天怎么这么大阵仗……","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_459_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡逻的惩戒军？","text":"喂，你。","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_459_1#1$1","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瑟缩的平民","text":"哎哟，长、长官，我刚刚已经跟一位审判官报告过了，住在这儿的岛民都很可疑，都该盘查，我——","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_459_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡逻的惩戒军？","text":"哦，所以你把我也报上去了？","id":271},{"type":"charslot","id":272},{"type":"dialog","id":273},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":274},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":275},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_459_1#1$1","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瑟缩的平民","text":"阿戈尔人……穿着惩戒军的制服……？","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_459_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#1$1","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"不好意思，翘班有点多，没在街道上见过我也正常。","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"这里是广场附近的街区，你周围住的都是打捞中心的技术工吧？昨天晚上宵禁之后，你听到外面有什么动静吗？","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_459_1#1$1","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瑟缩的平民","text":"没、没有，他们一般清晨才会出门，而且这几天晚上，他们家里的鳞油灯都点得很亮，没有什么异常。","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_459_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#1$1","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"你确定你的观察无误？","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_459_1#1$1","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瑟缩的平民","text":"我胆子小……每天都会确认的……","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_459_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#1$1","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"没有异常，很好，那这里就排除了。","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#3$1","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"剩下的只有——","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":291},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":292},{"type":"charslot","id":293},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_bg_74_g3_seasidest_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":294},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":295},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#9$1","duration":"1","id":296},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"东侧临海的这座废弃工坊了。","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"只为疑惑、困苦、向往和平的阿戈尔人开门的教堂，给我解答吧。","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"到底是谁躲在背后，为了何种目的，煽动我的同胞？","id":300,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":301},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_gateopen","id":302},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":303},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":304},{"type":"bgeffect","id":305},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":306},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":307},{"type":"image","id":308},{"type":"charslot","text":"","id":309}],"characters":["通讯声A","通讯声B","无线电","岛民","墙上的刻字","守塔人A","守塔人B","惩戒军士官","惩戒军士兵","？？？","圣徒卡门","制帆匠","特菲","瑟缩的平民","巡逻的惩戒军？","德鲁莎"]}